{"id":"dc9d6eee9578d7f8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-provably-recursive-functions.md","title":"Class of Provably Recursive Functions","display":"df-provably-recursive-functions — Class of Provably Recursive Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-provably-recursive-functions","aliases":["18-df-provably-recursive-functions","18-df-063"],"display":"df-provably-recursive-functions — Class of Provably Recursive Functions","depends_on":["[[18-df-provably-recursive-function]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Local notation for Definition 10.1.4","source_printed_pages":"209","source_pdf_pages":"219","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-provably-recursive-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-provably-recursive-functions</span><span>18-df-063</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provably-recursive-functions — Class of Provably Recursive Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"115b03357940aa38\" href=\"?note=115b03357940aa38\" title=\"18-df-provably-recursive-function\">18-df-provably-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Local notation for Definition 10.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"219"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"115b03357940aa38\" href=\"?note=115b03357940aa38\" title=\"18-df-provably-recursive-function\">18-df-provably-recursive-function</a> 的全部条件，计算编码由该节点的本地依赖固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\)</span> 取其精确定义，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 均为一元总函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvRec}(\\mathfrak T)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega:\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProvRec}(\\mathfrak T)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega:\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是为原书 Definition 10.1.4 增加的本地集合记号，不冒充原书另一个编号定义。改变计算编码接口时，应使用可相互有效翻译且理论可验证的正规形编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-provably-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"115b03357940aa38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-provably-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provably-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"115b03357940aa38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$ 满足 [[18-df-provably-recursive-function]] 的全部条件，计算编码由该节点的本地依赖固定。$\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)$ 取其精确定义，所有 $f$ 均为一元总函数 $\\omega\\to\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvRec}(\\mathfrak T)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in{}^\\omega\\omega:\\mathrm{ProvablyRecursive}_{\\mathfrak T}(f)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1610,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-provably-recursive-functions]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"真实程序总性加外部计算语义；函数类见 [[../18-df-provably-recursive-functions]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provably-recursive-functions]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provably-recursive-functions|18-df-provably-recursive-functions]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-provably-recursive-functions|18-df-provably-recursive-functions]]"}],"outgoing":["115b03357940aa38"]}